.pnpm-store
# The bearer token is NOT here and must never be. It lives at ~/.agentdeck/token, mode 0600,
# created on first run; AGENTDECK_TOKEN_FILE moves it. There is no container and no mount left to
# place it behind - agentdeck runs on the Mac as you - so placement is the whole control, and the
# rule that survives de-containerising is that it is never inside a tree a session is pointed at,
# where an agent's own `ls -la` or `grep -rn token .` meets it. The server refuses to start if the
# path resolves inside an allowlist entry.

# Isolated checkouts for parallel agents. Whole copies of this repo; never committed.
.claude/worktrees
